@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Component Diagram - 006 My Classroom Activities & Close Room
left to right direction

actor Teacher
actor Student

package "Next.js App (Node.js runtime)" {
	component "Teacher Workspace Page\n/teacher/import\n(我的課堂活動 + import)" as Workspace
	component "Teacher Activity List\n(server-rendered)" as ListUI
	component "Teacher Console\n(返回教師工作區, 房間狀態)" as Console
	component "Close Room Control\n(in-page confirm)" as CloseUI
	component "Student Activity Page\n(活動已結束 banner)" as StudentUI
	component "Activity Lifecycle\n<<pure>> status / sort / phase" as Lifecycle
	component "Teacher Activities Route\nGET /api/teacher/activities" as ListAPI
	component "Close Room Route\nPOST /api/activities/{id}/close" as CloseAPI
	component "Import Service\n(records the activity for its teacher)" as Import
	component "Teacher Activities Service\nrecordTeacherActivity / listTeacherActivities" as TeacherActivities
	component "Round Service\ncloseActivityRoom" as RoundService
	component "Round Store (Lua)\nclose-rounds.lua mode end-activity\nopen-rounds / submit-answer reject ended" as RoundStore
	component "Join Service\n(rejects ended activities)" as Join
	component "Activity SSE + Projection\n(activity.ended to everyone)" as Sync
}

database "Private Redis\nteacher:{teacherId}:activities (zset)\nactivity:{id}:meta phase = ended" as Redis

Teacher --> Workspace : land after login / rail 教師工作區
Workspace --> ListUI : render own activities
ListUI --> TeacherActivities : listTeacherActivities(session teacher)
ListUI --> Lifecycle : status label + ongoing-first order
ListUI --> Console : link per activity
Teacher --> Console : 返回教師工作區 / control questions
Console --> CloseUI
CloseUI --> CloseAPI : confirm 關閉房間
ListAPI --> TeacherActivities
CloseAPI --> RoundService
RoundService --> RoundStore
Import --> TeacherActivities : recordTeacherActivity(teacher, activity, createdAt)
TeacherActivities --> Redis : ZADD / ZREVRANGE / MGET meta / ZREM expired
RoundStore --> Redis : close every open round + phase ended + events (atomic)
Join --> Redis : phase check
Sync --> Redis : read event Stream
Sync --> Console : results.finalized ... activity.ended
Sync --> StudentUI : results.finalized ... activity.ended
Student --> StudentUI : sees 活動已結束 + published results
Console --> Lifecycle : phase stays ended

note bottom of Redis
	The index is a sorted set (score = createdAt ms) per teacher,
	expiring with the activity; entries whose activity meta has
	expired are removed lazily when the list is read.
	"ended" is terminal: join, open and submit are rejected,
	writeback of closed rounds is still allowed.
end note
@enduml
